WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.837
Indicators and signposts help analysts identify events or observations that suggest a

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.000
situation may be changing.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.972
They connect current judgments to future evidence.

00:00:07.972 --> 00:00:11.050
Teams can ask what developments would support the assessment,

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.995
what developments would challenge it, and which observable events should be monitored.

00:00:13.995 --> 00:00:17.950
Indicators support adaptive thinking by preventing conclusions from becoming frozen.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.990
If the environment changes, the assessment should have a way to update.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:24.955
This technique is useful in cybersecurity, investigations, risk management,

00:00:24.955 --> 00:00:28.960
business planning, and any environment where conditions can shift quickly.
